1945  EE89 28 05                JR   Z,$EE90
1946  EE8B CD AD EE             CALL $EEAD
1947  EE8E 38 F8                JR   C,$EE88
1948  EE90 4D                   LD   C, L
1949  EE91 D9                   EXX
1950  EE92 ED 73 34 2C          LD   ($2C34), SP
